packages/bootstrap/Python/

# Claude Code workspace config. Two entries ARE tracked. `launch.json` names the dev
# servers `/run` and the browser preview start. `skills/` holds repo rules that every
# session must load, so it belongs to the repo the same way AGENTS.md does. The siblings
# do not: settings.local.json is per-machine permissions and env, the lock holds a live
# pid, and worktrees/ is scratch.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json
!.claude/skills/
